{"format":1,"id":"ziel_klar","kurz":"zk","sprache":"en","richtung":"ltr","titel":"Clarifying a goal","untertitel":"In four steps: wish, best outcome, inner obstacle and an if-then plan.","haltung":["sitzen"],"augen":"zu_oder_offen","ende":"glocke","schlaf_modus":false,"laengen":{"kurz":{"ziel_s":300},"normal":{"ziel_s":480},"lang":{"ziel_s":720}},"kb":817,"abschnitte":[{"id":"ankommen","segmente":[{"id":"s001","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/1.bd1b3945.mp3","ms":7418,"text":"Sit comfortably and upright. Close your eyes if you like. You can stop at any time.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s002","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/2.9df70288.mp3","ms":2298,"text":"Take a few calm breaths in and out.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s003","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/3.9f249f76.mp3","ms":5913,"text":"This exercise has four steps: wish, best outcome, obstacle, and plan.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}}]},{"id":"wunsch","segmente":[{"id":"s004","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/4.98f3f97a.mp3","ms":8119,"text":"Think of a wish for the next few weeks. Something that matters to you, that challenges you a little, and that you can achieve.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s005","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/5.696470bd.mp3","ms":4374,"text":"It might have to do with work, money, health, or other people.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s006","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/6.aa3917ce.mp3","ms":3540,"text":"If several come to mind, choose just one for today.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s007","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/7.10274cc5.mp3","ms":6470,"text":"Sum up your wish in a few words. For example: I put some money aside every month.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"st01","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":30.8,"normal":34.2,"lang":47.8}}]},{"id":"ergebnis","segmente":[{"id":"s008","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/8.b6990298.mp3","ms":5028,"text":"Now imagine you have achieved it. What would be the best thing about it?","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s009","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/9.c0cb333b.mp3","ms":3454,"text":"How does that feel? What would be different?","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"s010","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/10.edfe4d51.mp3","ms":2785,"text":"Let yourself imagine it for a few breaths.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"st02","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":30.8,"normal":34.2,"lang":47.8}}]},{"id":"hindernis","segmente":[{"id":"s011","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/11.4ba01168.mp3","ms":5888,"text":"Now comes an important step. Ask yourself: What in me stands in the way?","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s012","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/12.f988e5e1.mp3","ms":6772,"text":"Not the circumstances, but something within you. A habit, a feeling, a thought.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s013","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/13.e71d67e9.mp3","ms":7845,"text":"For example: I put things off. I'm afraid of being turned down. I'm too tired in the evening.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st03","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":30.8,"normal":34.2,"lang":47.8}},{"id":"s014","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/14.251cc86d.mp3","ms":5773,"text":"Picture the situation where this obstacle shows up. As clearly as you can.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"s015","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/15.80b21745.mp3","ms":3729,"text":"Where are you? What are you thinking in that moment?","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"st04","art":"stille","in":["normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"normal":34.2,"lang":47.8}}]},{"id":"plan","segmente":[{"id":"s016","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/16.39aa523b.mp3","ms":8162,"text":"Now make a plan with two parts. Something like: If this obstacle shows up, then I will do something specific.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s017","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/17.5f00e81e.mp3","ms":6559,"text":"For example: If I'm tired in the evening, then I'll still get started, even if only for five minutes.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s018","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/18.5919a5dd.mp3","ms":4737,"text":"Or: If I'm afraid of being turned down, then I'll send the message anyway.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s019","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/19.fb9dbacd.mp3","ms":3633,"text":"Now find your own plan. If, then.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":6,"normal":10,"lang":16}},{"id":"st05","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":30.8,"normal":34.2,"lang":47.8}},{"id":"s020","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/20.e2bc3a81.mp3","ms":3693,"text":"Silently say your plan to yourself once, slowly.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"s021","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/21.ff58e5b7.mp3","ms":6709,"text":"And run through it in your mind. The obstacle shows up. And you do what you planned.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":10,"lang":16}},{"id":"st06","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":47.8}}]},{"id":"erster_schritt","segmente":[{"id":"s022","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/22.be2c8a35.mp3","ms":4401,"text":"What is the very first step? When and where will you take it?","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"s023","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/23.9ade04a0.mp3","ms":5970,"text":"Picture yourself taking this step in detail. Not the success, but the doing.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":16}},{"id":"st07","art":"stille","in":["normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"normal":34.2,"lang":47.8}}]},{"id":"rueckkehr","segmente":[{"id":"s024","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/24.03921f0c.mp3","ms":6797,"text":"This exercise doesn't replace taking action. It can help you plan more clearly and keep going.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s025","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/25.d1bdf9a9.mp3","ms":4253,"text":"If you like, write down your wish and your if-then plan right away.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s026","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/26.55be4530.mp3","ms":3445,"text":"Take one deep breath in and out, and open your eyes.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":1,"normal":2,"lang":3}},{"id":"glocke","art":"glocke","ton":"ende"}]}]}